---
// Raquette : la déflexion de la tige d'une raquette de badminton (TIPE de Ferdinand Lacroix).
// La tige est une poutre encastrée (δ = F L³ / 3EI = K·F) ; en swing, elle se comporte comme un système masse-ressort :
// la tête prend du retard sur le manche, puis « fouette » et le dépasse. Deux raquettes réelles du TIPE, avec leurs mesures.
// Glisser : orbite. Clic, geste rapide ou espace : swing.
import HeroShell from './HeroShell.astro';
---
<HeroShell name="racket" scrim={false}>
  <div class="hud" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="corner tl"></span><span class="corner tr"></span><span class="corner bl"></span><span class="corner br"></span>
    <div class="lbl l-tl">
      RACKET / 010<br />SHAFT.DEFLECTION
      <span class="eq">δ = F L³ / 3EI = K·F</span>
      <span class="eq e2 mh">ẍ<sub>T</sub> + ω₀² x<sub>T</sub> = ω₀² x<sub>M</sub></span>
    </div>
    <div class="lbl l-tr">
      <span class="row"><i>K<sub>exp</sub></i><b data-k>0</b> mm/N</span>
      <span class="row dim"><i>K<sub>th</sub></i><b data-kth>0</b> mm/N</span>
      <span class="row mh"><i>E</i><b data-e>0</b> GPa</span>
      <span class="row dim"><i>I</i><b>117.8</b> mm⁴</span>
      <span class="row mh"><i>ω₀</i><b data-w0>0</b> rad/s</span>
      <span class="row"><i>ω̃ = ω/ω₀</i><b data-wt>0</b></span>
      <span class="row dim"><i>T</i><b data-tc>00:00:000</b></span>
      <span class="row slow" data-slowrow><i><span data-l="fr">ralenti</span><span data-l="en">slow-mo</span></i><b data-slow>×1</b></span>
    </div>

    <div class="cue" data-cue><span class="cue-txt" data-cuetxt></span></div>

    <div class="panel">
      <div class="ctrls">
        <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Raquette / Racket" data-rk>
          <button type="button" data-v="perfly" class="on">Perfly Lite <small><span data-l="fr">carbone</span><span data-l="en">carbon</span></small></button>
          <button type="button" data-v="babolat">Babolat <small><span data-l="fr">acier</span><span data-l="en">steel</span></small></button>
        </div>
        <div class="seg sm" role="group" aria-label="Masse en tête / Head mass" data-mass>
          <span class="seg-l"><span data-l="fr">masse en tête</span><span data-l="en">head mass</span></span>
          <button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">+0 g</button><button type="button" data-v="40">+40</button><button type="button" data-v="90">+90</button><button type="button" data-v="180">+180</button>
        </div>
        <label class="slider">
          <span class="seg-l"><span data-l="fr">durée du swing τ₁</span><span data-l="en">swing time τ₁</span></span>
          <input type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="0" data-tau aria-label="τ1" />
          <b data-tauv>70 ms</b>
        </label>
      </div>
      <div class="p-body">
        <div class="scopebox">
          <div class="p-head">
            <span><span data-l="fr">Vitesses et déflexion<span class="lg"> au cours du swing</span></span><span data-l="en">Speeds and deflection<span class="lg"> during the swing</span></span></span>
          </div>
          <canvas class="scope" data-scope></canvas>
          <div class="legend">
            <span><i class="lg-line lm"></i><span data-l="fr">manche</span><span data-l="en">handle</span></span>
            <span><i class="lg-line lt"></i><span data-l="fr">tête</span><span data-l="en">head</span></span>
            <span><i class="lg-area"></i><span class="nt">δ(t)</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gainbox">
          <div class="p-head"><span class="nt">v<sub>T</sub> / v<sub>M</sub> (ω̃)</span></div>
          <canvas class="gain" data-gain></canvas>
          <div class="legend mh"><span><i class="lg-dot"></i><span data-l="fr">ce swing</span><span data-l="en">this swing</span></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="verdict" data-verdict>
        <span data-l="fr">Cliquez pour lancer un swing et voir la tige se courber.</span><span data-l="en">Click to swing and watch the shaft bend.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="p-vals">
        <span><i><span data-l="fr">Déflexion max <span class="nt">δ</span></span><span data-l="en">Max deflection <span class="nt">δ</span></span></i><b data-dmax>–</b></span>
        <span><i><span data-l="fr">Gain tête / manche</span><span data-l="en">Head / handle gain</span></i><b data-gainv>–</b></span>
        <span><i><span data-l="fr">Volant<span class="lg"> (estimation)</span></span><span data-l="en">Shuttle<span class="lg"> (estimate)</span></span></i><b data-vs>–</b></span>
        <span class="mh"><i><span data-l="fr">Vitesse max manche</span><span data-l="en">Max handle speed</span></i><b data-vm>–</b></span>
        <span class="mh"><i><span data-l="fr">Vitesse max tête</span><span data-l="en">Max head speed</span></i><b data-vt>–</b></span>
        <span><i><span data-l="fr">Mesuré au TIPE</span><span data-l="en">Measured (TIPE)</span></i><b data-meas>–</b></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- encart d'explication (refermable, réouvrable via le bouton « ? ») -->
  <button class="help" type="button" data-help aria-controls="rk-intro" aria-expanded="true">
    <b>?</b><span data-l="fr">Comment ça marche</span><span data-l="en">How it works</span>
  </button>
  <aside class="intro" id="rk-intro" data-intro role="dialog" aria-labelledby="rk-intro-t">
    <button class="x" type="button" data-close aria-label="Fermer / Close">×</button>
    <h2 id="rk-intro-t"><span data-l="fr">La déflexion de la raquette</span><span data-l="en">Racket shaft deflection</span></h2>
    <dl>
      <dt><span data-l="fr">Ce que vous voyez</span><span data-l="en">What you see</span></dt>
      <dd>
        <span data-l="fr">Pendant le swing, la tige se courbe : la tête prend du retard sur le manche, puis elle « fouette » et va plus vite que lui. Ensuite la tige oscille et s’amortit.</span>
        <span data-l="en">During the swing the shaft bends: the head lags behind the handle, then whips forward and moves faster than it. The shaft then oscillates and settles.</span>
      </dd>
      <dt><span data-l="fr">À vous de jouer</span><span data-l="en">Your turn</span></dt>
      <dd>
        <span data-l="fr">Choisissez une raquette, ajoutez de la masse en tête, réglez la durée du swing, puis <b>cliquez</b> (ou faites un <b>geste rapide</b>). <b>Glissez</b> pour tourner autour.</span>
        <span data-l="en">Pick a racket, add mass to the head, set the swing time, then <b>click</b> (or <b>flick</b>). <b>Drag</b> to orbit.</span>
      </dd>
      <dt><span data-l="fr">Le modèle</span><span data-l="en">The model</span></dt>
      <dd>
        <span data-l="fr">La tige est une poutre encastrée : δ = F L³ / 3EI = K·F. J’ai mesuré K = 9,9 mm/N (Perfly Lite BR560, carbone, 80 g, 675 mm) et 7,5 mm/N (Babolat Speedlighter, acier, 105 g, 662 mm), pour 9,1 et 7,0 en théorie. En swing, la tête est une masse reliée au manche par ce ressort : le gain de vitesse dépend de ω̃ = ω/ω₀, avec un maximum de 1,77 vers ω̃ ≈ 0,6.</span>
        <span data-l="en">The shaft is a cantilever beam: δ = F L³ / 3EI = K·F. I measured K = 9.9 mm/N (Perfly Lite BR560, carbon, 80 g, 675 mm) and 7.5 mm/N (Babolat Speedlighter, steel, 105 g, 662 mm), against 9.1 and 7.0 in theory. In a swing, the head is a mass tied to the handle by this spring: the speed gain depends on ω̃ = ω/ω₀, peaking at 1.77 near ω̃ ≈ 0.6.</span>
      </dd>
      <dt>TIPE</dt>
      <dd>
        <span data-l="fr">Tiré de mon TIPE de prépa « La déflexion de la raquette de badminton ». Mes mesures (lancer à l’électroaimant, vidéo puis accéléromètre) donnent des rapports tête / manche de 0,6 à 1,6 selon la raquette et la masse ajoutée.</span>
        <span data-l="en">From my prépa research project (TIPE) “Badminton racket deflection”. My measurements (electromagnet launch, video then accelerometer) gave head / handle ratios from 0.6 to 1.6 depending on the racket and the added mass.</span>
      </dd>
    </dl>
    <button class="ok" type="button" data-ok><span data-l="fr">Compris, à moi</span><span data-l="en">Got it</span></button>
  </aside>
  <p class="fallback">
    <span data-l="fr">WebGL n’est pas disponible sur cet appareil : la raquette ne peut pas être affichée.</span>
    <span data-l="en">WebGL is not available on this device, so the racket cannot be displayed.</span>
  </p>
  <slot />
</HeroShell>

<style>
